=== Qucs hello Verilog world

The new schematic format plays well with other tools.
For simulation, load the circuit into a simulator (not part of Qucs).

== edit schematic (old)

edit legacy schematic data
$ qucs -i helloworld.sch

convert to standard format
$ qucs -i helloworld.sch --dump -t vs -o helloworld.vs

== edit schematic (new)

no more need for legacy data
$ qucs -i helloworld.vs

== simulate circuit

Here's a small demo script, have a look, less is more.
$ less commands.gc

run it with
$ gnucap commands.gc
[..]

